## DI Registration

```csharp
// Correct — same as Service layer
[DependencyInjection(typeof(IMemberProvider))]
public class MemberProvider : IMemberProvider { ... }

[DependencyInjection(typeof(IMemberValidator))]
public class MemberValidator : IMemberValidator { ... }

[DependencyInjection(typeof(IMemberTransfer))]
public class MemberTransfer : IMemberTransfer { ... }
```

Lifetime MUST be Singleton. Do NOT use `AddScoped` in Startup for these types.

