## Self-Check for Infrastructure Files

Before finishing, verify:
- [ ] Only Provider / Validator / Transfer classes present?
- [ ] Provider has no business logic or validation?
- [ ] Validator has no DB / external system access?
- [ ] Transfer has no validation or DB access?
- [ ] Grouped by entity, not by scenario (no `MemberCreateValidator`, `MemberDBTransfer`)?
- [ ] Data access uses ECCore managers (not raw drivers / Dapper / EF)?
- [ ] Redis keys follow `{Module}:{Feature}:{Key}` and include expiration?
- [ ] Cassandra queries include partition key?
- [ ] `[DependencyInjection]` on each class, Singleton lifetime?
- [ ] New/modified private methods use camelCase; private fields use `_camelCase` (see `naming.mdc`)?
